  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5607.02 Processing Opt-Out",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5607.02 Processing Opt-Out.\n\n(a) Applicants for an opt out shall return form DSMV 506 to the Department of Safety, Division of Motor Vehicle, Attn: Assistant Director, 23 Hazen Drive, Concord, NH, 03305.\n\n(b) The Department shall process opt out forms within 40 days of receipt.\n\n(c) All opt out applications shall be confidential.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #13152, EXEMPT, eff 12-31-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
